This product includes software ported from langchain-agent-hints
(https://github.com/evan7ang/langchain-agent-hints), which is licensed under the
Mulan Permissive Software License, Version 2:

- the base64url wire codec and the token-estimation / logical-message-count
  helpers (src/deerflow_agent_hints/wire.py, src/deerflow_agent_hints/policy.py);
- the manage-request reliability model: per-session serialization, resume-only
  bounded retries, isolation on unknown mutation outcomes
  (src/deerflow_agent_hints/control.py).

The wire contract implemented here is the Agent Hint protocol v1.0
(agent-hint-protocol.md). The ported code was rewritten for strict v1.0 wire
emission, DeerFlow session identity, async transport, and DeerFlow lifecycle
triggers.
